cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use nedCAPTCHA 2 in work that produces a research output, please cite this software and cite REDCap separately."
type: software
title: "nedCAPTCHA 2 (REDCap External Module)"
abstract: "nedCAPTCHA 2 is a REDCap External Module that adds CAPTCHA protection to public surveys without using external CAPTCHA services. It supports math, distorted-image, and custom challenge-response CAPTCHAs configured through REDCap action tags on the first public survey page."
